# Root ignore file for builders that do not read <Dockerfile>.dockerignore (e.g. Render). Same rules as
# apps/api/Dockerfile.dockerignore; keep them in sync. UNTESTED (no Docker on the authoring machine).
**/node_modules
**/.next*
**/dist
**/build
**/out
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/blob-report
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
.git
.github
.local
.vendor
.spike
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env.local
Collara Website
docs
daml/**/.daml
